Each copied file carries the header
  "Modified from rakazo (Apache-2.0), github.com/elie222/rakazo@912c977".
Changes made: import paths rewritten from @rakazo/* workspace packages to local "@/..." aliases,
lingui i18n macros removed (plain English strings), rakazo-only types and helpers trimmed,
and the localStorage appearance key renamed to "nlhack.uiAppearance".

